		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">0</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">As per the problem statement, we have to print -1 in some scenarios. We have 4 scenarios below. In which of these scenarios should we print -1? 
S1: When all elements of array are same 
S2: When all the elements of the array are negative 
S3: When frequency of all the elements in the array is same 
S4: When none of the element in the array has frequency equal to its value</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">1300.8398977555723</attribute>
				<attribute key="y" type="double">675.9789010587317</attribute>
				<attribute key="w" type="double">307.7660045720926</attribute>
