		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">33</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints for coming up with new test cases.

1. Normal test cases - length of the list is like 5, 8, 10 etc.
1.1 Only 1 lucky number
1.2. Multiple lucky numbers

2. Boundary test cases
2.1. All the vlaues in the list are same
2.2. List have multiple values and only last value is lucky number


Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 4 new test cases.
Write them on a paper along with the expected output.</attribute>
