		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">34</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">We have completed 2 steps in problem solving approach.
1. Understanding the problem statement
2. Coming up with new test cases

3rd step is "Coming up with logic"</attribute>
