			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some common mistakes.
1. Not converting string to integer
2. Not writing the loop condition correctly
3. Not using the brackets correctly
4. Printing extra output
5. Comparing frequency of number to its value at incorrect place.
6.Not assigning value of variable count again to 1, or assigning it at incorrect place.
7. Using break statement at incorrect place (if you are using it).
8. Not handling boundary conditions (observe the boundary test cases), especially the case when last number of the list is lucky number.</attribute>
