b. Initialize an empty array (step 2)
c. Creating new variables (step 6)
d. Append an element in array.(step 4)
e. Comparing numbers (steps 9, 11.1 and 15)
f. Displaying output (steps 11.2, 15.1 and 15.2)
g. Repeating the process for one number at a time (steps 5 and 12)
h. Break statement- (step 11.2)
i. Create an empty array(step 2).

We have discussed all of the above in previous assignments multiple times. Take a paper and write the code for our algorithm.</attribute>
